 trial, the trial keeps running and its end bills the new plan. Sending ",[294,1324,1325],{},"invoiceImmediately: true",[294,1327,1328],{},"anchor",[294,1330,1331],{},"resetAnchor",[294,1333,627],{}," or a plan with a different interval with ",[294,1336,1287],{}," returns ",[294,1339,1340],{},"422",[273,1342,1343,1348,1352],{},[291,1344,1345],{},[294,1346,1347],{},"applyImmediately",[291,1349,1350],{},[294,1351,366],{},[291,1353,1354,1355,1357,1358,1360],{},"Apply the change now (",[294,1356,1280],{},") or at the end of the current period (",[294,1359,1287],{},", default).",[273,1362,1363,1368,1372],{},[291,1364,1365],{},[294,1366,1367],{},"invoiceImmediately",[291,1369,1370],{},[294,1371,366],{},[291,1373,1374,1375,1377,1378,1380,1381,1383,1384,1386,1387,1393],{},"Generate and charge a proration invoice immediately. Only applies when ",[294,1376,1347],{}," and ",[294,1379,1270],{}," are both ",[294,1382,1280],{},". Defaults to ",[294,1385,1287],{},", which parks the proration delta on the current cycle and bills it as a line on the next renewal invoice (and waives it if the subscription is cancelled first). ",[1174,1388,1389,1390,1392],{},"Set this to ",[294,1391,1280],{}," on yearly and other long-interval plans",", where the deferral to the next renewal costs you the most.",[273,1395,1396,1400,1404],{},[291,1397,1398],{},[294,1399,1328],{},[291,1401,1402],{},[294,1403,515],{},[291,1405,1406,1407,1410,1411,326],{},"Set the billing anchor to a specific date (",[294,1408,1409],{},"YYYY-MM-DD",", UTC). Cannot be combined with ",[294,1412,1331],{},[273,1414,1415,1419,1423],{},[291,1416,1417],{},[294,1418,1331],{},[291,1420,1421],{},[294,1422,366],{},[291,1424,1425,1426,326],{},"Reset the billing anchor to now. Cannot be combined with ",[294,1427,1328],{},[273,1429,1430,1434,1438],{},[291,1431,1432],{},[294,1433,627],{},[291,1435,1436],{},[294,1437,515],{},[291,1439,1440,1441,326],{},"Extend or set a trial until this date (ISO 8601). Cannot be combined with ",[294,1442